# No history comments: state the reason (WHY) in the present tense, keep history in commits and issues (conventions §7.5, 7.6)
description=No history narration ("예전에는" / "예전엔", i.e. "in the past") in code comments and docstrings
paths=src/,scripts/common/,skills/
extensions=.js,.mjs,.py
pattern=예전(?:에는|엔)
